<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Oxygen 9-month net 7 pct up.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Oxygen 9-month net 7 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Oxygen Ltd for the nine to September 30, of the 1996 financial year. (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			 9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    336.99	vs	  294.60</p>
<p>    Net profit	   35.60	vs	   33.15</p>
<p>    Tax provision	19.20	vs	   18.00</p>
<p>NOTE- The company, a unit of Norwegian industrial gas giant Norsk Hydro, is the main supplier of industrial and medical gases in Sri Lanka.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
